      "title": "最后的武士·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34307001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "时间倒回昨天深夜——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Bad luck，竹刀……断掉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "呼，事务所最近接到过不少counselling，你就是那所谓的「恶魔」吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "无趣的称谓，和你的剑术一样无趣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "这可轮不到半夜砍手办的lunatic说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "你习惯了安逸生活，变得比以前更弱了。\n你多久没有练剑了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "唔！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "反应很快，姑且保住了你的右手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "……走火入魔了吗，山崎？\nI remember你以前不是这样子的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "不知道，但此刻我的心久违地安宁下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "伊达，你的「烛台切」呢，你的「亘理来国光」呢？\n不堪一击的竹刀，就是你的归宿吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Crazy……你到底是为了什么在挥剑？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "为了什么在挥剑？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……是为了抵达终极的剑意。\n无法全力以赴的你，甚至没有成为战利品的价值。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34307016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "银光一闪，政宗头顶的墙壁留下了一道深深的沟壑。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "……Well，他就这样放我走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "也就是说，他没砍掉你的手，或者脚？\n好吧，也看得出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "服部平藏",
          "text": "有意思，觉得胜之不武就放弃了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我记得山崎……曾经在阿尔法防线附近出现过的流浪武士，是终焉抵抗军的一员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "这不像是他会干的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "他的情况not right，整个人都像陷入了一种……平静的疯狂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我在|101|那见过山崎，最多只是话少了点。怎么会变成这样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "服部平藏",
          "text": "武士就是这样，因习剑堕入修罗也毫无自知。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "会有人知道山崎的行踪吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "I have tried。\n他居无定所，独来独往，谁也不知道他在哪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "可以换一个思路，目前来看，他是在晚上找厉害的手办练剑吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "试刀，或者说，challenge？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34371013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "没错，那就有办法把他引出来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34372001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……这样真的行得通吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34372002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "肯定可以，我们再去别的地方贴几份。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34372003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "M城大名鼎鼎的浮游炮小姐的挑战书……那位武士总不会怯战吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-793",
