      "title": "最后的武士·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34308001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "雨越下越大了……山崎难道没看到挑战书吗？\n呃，你表情怎么这么凝重？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……激光武器在雨雪天气下威力会大幅减弱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那可麻烦了，我们能和他商量下，把场地挪到室内吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "没事，只要近身保证射程就可以了。\n而且……手办配件化的「帕拉斯」已经很难说是激光武器了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达显示有复数个目标在接近当前坐标。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "有多个目标？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "桀桀桀，你果然在这里，浮游炮！\n真是约了个好地方啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "曾经你无情地挫败了我们独占涂料仓库的计划，现在就是你付出代价的时候了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "不止我们，曾经败在你手的手办可都在往这边赶过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "呜哇，挑战书引来了奇怪的家伙。\n你认识他们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不太想承认我还记得。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308012",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达显示有大量目标接近。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "恶党们要来这边开派对了。\n你以前就不能下手重点吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "先让对面失去行动能力吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "没意见，干翻他们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "唔！\n怎么回事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "老大！咕呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "发、发生了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308019",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "深黑色的雨幕里隐现出武士银色的臂甲。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "刀锋划开了雨点，他静静矗立。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "夜半深丛旁，独饮剑雨夺月明，惶惶无归期。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "——山崎，前来拜访。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……泉，帮我把那些混混手办赶走。\n避免不必要的伤亡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这和说好的不一样吧，你要独自对付他？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……拜托你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "撑住，我很快就会回来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "我记得你……用六对浮游炮摧毁了「极端思维」的机甲攻势。\n现在只有一对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308028",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>解除开火限制，调整输出功率上限至最大。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我会阻止你的暴行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34308030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "请多指教。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-794",
