      ],
      "title": "最后的武士·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34309001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>Pallas-A装甲受损，动力损失20%，输出功率下降50%。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309002",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>Pallas-B动力装置受创，动力损失60%，进入低速状态。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "这一只浮游炮我收下了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……休想！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "从另一侧射来的激光打偏了山崎的刀锋，让浮游炮躲过一劫。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "有趣，但你还能坚持多久？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……不对劲。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309008",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "他的植入义体始终维持着细微的震动，这是失控的表现。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "合金——气流斩！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "希塔翻滚避开，拔刀斩瞬间粉碎了她身后的石砖。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>切换作战回路，远程链接模块全功率运行。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "开始骇入。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>远程链接建立，进度60％……80％……100％。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "过载目标义体，停止其活动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>解码进行中……进度30%。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309016",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：逻辑防火墙侦测到异常入侵。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309018",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>链接中出现未知语音片段，即将开始播放……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "特征和那些机甲的很相似……是病毒？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309020",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「哟，(嘈杂的声音）。」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「好久不见，你还记得我吗？」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309022",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「离开了贫民窟的你，大概已经全部忘记了吧。」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309023",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「毕竟从一开始，你就只在意……」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "断开链接……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309025",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「但我也没那么记仇，来玩个刺激的游戏吧，就像以前一样……好不好？」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309026",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "断开链接！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309027",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "当希塔回到现实时，山崎的刀锋已经近在眼前——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309028",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「阿尔贝尔」，撞飞他！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "居然打扰我们的决斗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "街头打架可没规定必须一对一吧？\n……你还好吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……暂时还能动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34309032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好，第二回合开始了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "浮游炮已经重创了他的背甲……为什么他还这么精神？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……或许是因为他义体里运行着的来源不明的病毒，让他一直处于高度亢奋的状态。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "咳，我可以再试试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我会尽力给你争取时间。可恶，要不是轮胎被砍到了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "山崎拖着太刀，一步步朝两人靠近。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……我听见了海浪声，奇怪的旋律。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "为什么，会如此熟悉？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "那是曾经来过77号贫民窟的一个街头艺人演奏的音乐——你的义体里记录了这段电子编曲。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……想不起来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "武士闭上双眼，静静聆听自体内鸣响的浪潮。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "你到底是为了什么在挥剑？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "哇哦，你喜欢我的音乐？\n布鲁特，这位大朋友是我们的粉丝耶。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "——曾经在破败的街道，街头艺人让复古与新潮交织的即兴编曲，让他顿悟了自己的道。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "为了抵达终极的剑意……是这样吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34560015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "山崎高高地举起了他的太刀，然后挥下。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
