      "title": "最后的武士·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34310001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……他斩下了自己的手臂？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310003",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "武士矗立在雨中，长久的沉默。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……我想起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "我……是为了让剑道在现代焕发新生，才一路至此。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……你清醒了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "真是惭愧，竟落到此番境地……\n为何会痴迷于挑战强者，被狂热蒙蔽了双目呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……是病毒的影响，我曾在失控的机甲那发现了类似的恶意代码。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "非也，定是我内心的痴妄还未被彻底斩却。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……山崎真是愧对浪客之名。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，你就这么走了吗？\n留下这一堆烂摊子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……病毒还没被彻底清除，叫不住他的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那也要把他留下，给事件一个交待！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "他不是真正的黑幕……犯人应该……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310015",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "话音刚落，希塔就倒在了地上。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "希塔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34310017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，你是怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "不久之后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "武士山崎取得的最后一个战利品，是自己的左臂吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "真是看到了相当精彩的画面啊~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "聒噪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "好险好险，你居然还有余力砍人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "给你个信息，我倒是有一些新出厂的替换肢体，比原装的还要强力。不试试吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "不必了，我明天就会离开M城——作为赎罪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "那就一点乐子都没有了。\n这就是所谓的武士的担当吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "……你到底是什么东西？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "有趣，丢失了手臂上的涂料，所以你忘记了我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "根据你的回答，我会决定我的态度。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "嗯？我就是一只平平无奇的机械兔啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "既没有恶魔的翅膀，也没有扭曲的长鞭……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "山崎",
          "text": "卑劣的欺诈师。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "多谢夸奖，嗯，我建议你先不要离开M城——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34374016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "因为好戏才刚刚上演，精彩的……还在后头呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
